  {
    "page": 12,
    "text": "Conclusion\n Expected Outcomes\n1. Personalization Enhancement\n→ Improves recommendation accuracy by reflecting both skin \ncharacteristics and user emotions.\n2. Emotion-Based Recommendation\n→ Provides customized results by analyzing positive and negative \nsentiments from user reviews.\nFuture Research Directions\n1. Integration of Multimodal Data Sources\n→ Incorporate ingredient composition, dermatological test results, and \nreal-time user feedback.\n2. User Study Validation\n→ Conduct A/B testing and real-user evaluations to verify performance and \nsatisfaction.\n3. Efficient Computation\n→ Reduces computational load and increases processing speed through \nskin profile filtering.\n3. Model Generalization Enhancement\n→ Expand model applicability across various skin types, age groups, and \ncultural backgrounds.",
